	abstract = {We experimentally demonstrate high optical quality factor silica microdisk resonators on a silicon chip with large wedge angles by reactive ion etching. For 2-\&\#x3BC;m-thick microresonators, we have achieved wedge angles of 59\&\#xB0;, 63\&\#xB0;, 70\&\#xB0;, and 79\&\#xB0; with optical quality factors of 2.4\&\#xD7;107, 8.1\&\#xD7;106, 5.9\&\#xD7;106, and 7.4\&\#xD7;106, respectively, from \&\#x223C;80\&\#x2009;\&\#x2009;\&\#x3BC;m-diameter microresonators in the 1550\&\#xA0;nm wavelength band. Also, for 1-\&\#x3BC;m-thick microresonators, we have obtained an optical quality factor of 7.3\&\#xD7;106 with a wedge angle of 74\&\#xB0;.},
	
